{"id":"2f215d3f10d33ae6","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-UTB.md","title":"闭项统一 Tarski 双条件理论","display":"df-UTB — 闭项统一 Tarski 双条件理论","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-UTB","aliases":["91-df-UTB","91-df-untyped-truth-base"],"display":"df-UTB — 闭项统一 Tarski 双条件理论","depends_on":["[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","[[91-df-induction-schema]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-UTB"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-UTB</span><span>91-df-untyped-truth-base</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-UTB — 闭项统一 Tarski 双条件理论"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"09791de618b277ba\" href=\"?note=09791de618b277ba\" title=\"91-df-induction-schema\">91-df-induction-schema</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 为基础算术，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> 为全真理语言归纳；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span> 为经典一阶闭包。所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_i\">\\(t_i\\)</span> 的对象量词均限制在闭项编码域。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\varphi(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>，列出其全部自由变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ge0\">\\(k\\ge0\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\\vec t)\">\\(\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\\vec t)\\)</span> 缩写依次无捕获代入闭项编码，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(\\operatorname{val}(t_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{val}(t_k))\">\\(\\varphi(\\operatorname{val}(t_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{val}(t_k))\\)</span> 是用求值代表公式展开的算术缩写。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}UTB}\\vdash\\quad\n\n\\operatorname{UTBic}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\forall t_1\\cdots\\forall t_k\\,\n\\left[T(\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\vec t))\n\\leftrightarrow\\varphi(\\operatorname{val}(t_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{val}(t_k))\\right]\n\\mid\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)=\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}UTB}\\vdash\\quad\n\n\\operatorname{UTBic}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\forall t_1\\cdots\\forall t_k\\,\n\\left[T(\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\vec t))\n\\leftrightarrow\\varphi(\\operatorname{val}(t_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{val}(t_k))\\right]\n\\mid\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)=\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UTB}^{-}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\operatorname{UTBic}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{UTB}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{UTB}^{-}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{UTB}^{-}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\operatorname{UTBic}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{UTB}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{UTB}^{-}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>U 表示 uniform，仍是类型化理论。历史别名 91-df-untyped-truth-base 只为保留已有链接，不表示 UTB 是无类型理论。这里一个标准公式给出一个量化所有闭项的公理；并未量化全部公式。\n与原书一致，UTB 包含全归纳，UTB减对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{utb}\\upharpoonright\">\\(\\mathrm{utb}\\upharpoonright\\)</span>。只使用数码代入给出较弱的另一表述；原书印刷页 54 明确区分二者。\n完整归纳 UTB 对 PA 保守，不能推出 PA 的全局反思或一致性。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 7.2–7.3、Theorem 7.5，印刷页 54–56，PDF 页 65–67。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-induction-schema","status":"resolved","id":"09791de618b277ba","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-induction-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\\vec t)$ 缩写依次无捕获代入闭项编码，见 [[91-df-coded-syntax]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}","display":false},{"tex":"t_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\ge0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\\vec t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(\\operatorname{val}(t_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{val}(t_k))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}UTB}\\vdash\\quad\n\n\\operatorname{UTBic}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\forall t_1\\cdots\\forall t_k\\,\n\\left[T(\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\vec t))\n\\leftrightarrow\\varphi(\\operatorname{val}(t_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{val}(t_k))\\right]\n\\mid\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)=\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\}\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UTB}^{-}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\operatorname{UTBic}_{\\mathcal L_0}(T)),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{UTB}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{UTB}^{-}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{utb}\\upharpoonright","display":false}],"bytes":2138,"backlinks":[{"id":"df4984a511d297c7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UTB}$、$\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}$ 采用 [[91-df-UTB]] 的全归纳版本。"},{"id":"9b3d91c91ef33900","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f23e822ba5d24954","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"30584c32b5f9ed53","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"73ccb673e6681e3d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4b28706879995352","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7e76f1ecb9ab7743","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-UTB]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-UTB]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]